license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: "3.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
keywords:
  - one-time pad
  - authenticated one-time pad
  - Wegman-Carter authentication
  - cryptography education
  - TPM rollback protection
  - post-quantum pad delivery
# No DOI, journal, conference, peer review, or external audit is claimed, and the
# 3.0.0 release does not create one. This metadata is repository-level only. The
# release bar this project actually applied is recorded in
# docs/RELEASE-CHECKLIST-3.0.md: zero unresolved HIGH findings, zero unresolved
# MEDIUM findings, and green software gates at the release SHA. Independent human
# security review, human TalkBack, human VoiceOver and physical TPM 2.0 validation
# were NOT performed and were not gates.
